    "body": "As discussed on #130, this might not work well with our colorblind support. It might be better to add a new module to indicate vi-status.\r\n\r\n@matchai I guess we have to decide now. Do we want to overwrite the prompt symbol or use a new module? FWIW, on testing this, it looks like after running a command, you will initially have the success/failure symbol, and it only changes to the vi symbol if you actually go into normal mode.",
