    "body": "Unfortunately, this is going to crash `zsh` when you try to eval, because the *entire* script is evaluated on one line.\r\n\r\nThere is a PR in progress to fix that, but until that's merged, we'll need to spam semicolons everywhere for this to successfully `eval`.\r\n\r\n```\r\nfunction zle-keymap-select\r\n{\r\n    PROMPT=$(starship prompt --keymap=$KEYMAP);\r\n    zle reset-prompt;\r\n};\r\nzle -N zle-keymap-select;\r\n```",
